"团队记忆" = "Team Memory";
"还没有笔记。Agent 在任务里记下的会出现在这里。" = "No notes yet. What agents note down in their runs shows up here.";
"Agent 写的：负责人、协作者和值班在任务里记下之后还用得上的事（怎么跑测试、踩过的坑、为什么这样做），每条记着谁在哪个任务里写的。" = "Agents write it: the lead, collaborators and Loops note what later runs will need (how to run the tests, a trap they fell into, why something is the way it is), each note saying who wrote it in which run.";
"不会塞进每个任务的说明里：Agent 只知道这里有多少条，需要时按关键词检索，拿到最相关的几条。它是笔记不是规则：用之前先核对，和共享资料冲突时以共享资料为准。" = "Notes are not put in every run's instructions: agents only learn how many there are, and search them when they need to, getting the best matches. Notes are not rules: they are checked before use, and the shared context wins when they disagree.";
"攒够 5 个交付的任务、且距上次超过一天，负责人自动整理一次：合并重复的、改正过时的、删掉没用的；也可以点右上角现在整理。" = "After 5 delivered runs and at least a day since the last time, the lead consolidates them on its own: merging duplicates, correcting what is out of date and removing what is of no use. You can also consolidate now with the button at the top right.";
"你可以改、删，或把一条加进共享资料，让它变成团队必须遵守的规则。" = "You can edit or delete a note, or add it to the shared context to make it a rule the team must follow.";
"%@怎么工作" = "How %@ Works";
"你写的，只有你能改；Agent 不能直接写进来。" = "You write it and only you can change it; agents cannot write to it.";
"每个任务开始时原样交给负责人和每个协作者，值班开工时也带上；和本次目标冲突时以目标为准。" = "Every run hands it as it is to the lead and every collaborator, and every Loop wake takes it along; when it disagrees with the goal, the goal wins.";
"任务开始时就固定下来，之后的修改从下一个任务起生效。" = "A run keeps the version it started with; changes apply from the next run.";
"负责人交付时会建议值得长期保留的新事实，你点「加入共享资料…」、确认保存后才写入。" = "When it delivers, the lead suggests new facts worth keeping; they are added only once you click Add to Shared Context… and save.";
